<title>THAILAND: Unocal farms into Thai gas project.</title>
<headline>Unocal farms into Thai gas project.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unocal Thailand said on Tuesday that Unocal Petroleum Ltd, an affiliate of Unocal Corp, had signed an agreement with Thailand's ministry of industry to farm into the Block B10/32 gas field in the Gulf of Thailand.</p>
</text>
